stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> OwnBootAbsent: own boot Herdr channel, row Missing/Retired, restart
    [*] --> Thread: thread under a Herdr parent, nothing judged
    [*] --> JournalHeld: handoff journal on a thread or a left channel

    OwnBootAbsent --> Started: Before/After StartAbsent (boot entry: HerdrFirstCreate/HerdrRetired)
    OwnBootAbsent --> OwnBootAbsent: Rev3 StartWatchAgain (empty cache: host_unresolved)

    Thread --> Judged: Judge (turn_host for_turn, After records it)
    Judged --> Thread: Restart (judged map is process memory)
    Thread --> ReadUnjudged: BusyInput
    Judged --> ReadJudged: BusyInput
    ReadUnjudged --> [*]: Before reads Tmux, After reads Unknown
    ReadJudged --> [*]: Before reads Tmux, After reads the judgement

    JournalHeld --> Dropped: JournalCheck, left (Before: no own boot entry, After: policy Tmux)
    JournalHeld --> Kept: JournalCheck, not left (After: policy Herdr or Unknown)
